title: "GPRadar: GPR processing and hyperbola detection prototype"
abstract: >-
  Research code for simulating (gprMax), preprocessing and detecting hyperbolas in ground-penetrating radar B-scans with a YOLO11n detector, compared with and without synthetic pre-training, and checked against GPRPy.
